  "notes": [
    "Edit freely or pass your own file with --pricing or PREFIXLENS_PRICING. prefixlens has no prices in its code.",
    "Models match by glob on the model id, lowercased, without any 'provider/' prefix and with '.' read as '-'. First match wins, so list specific patterns before general ones.",
    "cache_write is the 5-minute-TTL write price; cache_write_1h the 1-hour-TTL write price. Providers with implicit caching (OpenAI, Gemini) report no writes, so those fields are unused for them.",
    "tiers override rates when a request's prompt (uncached + cache read + cache write) is above above_prompt_tokens.",
    "Anthropic rates are first-party API list prices. OpenAI and Gemini rates are list prices last checked by hand and may be out of date: verify before relying on them."
